          "short": "$x(x+5)=7\\times8$, hence $x^2+5x-56=0$.",
          "worked": "The products of the intercepts of intersecting chords are equal.\n$$\\begin{align*}x(x+5)&=7\\times8\\\\x^2+5x&=56\\\\x^2+5x-56&=0\\end{align*}$$",
